 * cpu2 (controller = delegation CLIENT) devicetree overlay.
 *
 * Console (uart5) and memory layout come from the common overlays injected by
 * CMakeLists.txt (cpu2_console_uart5.overlay / cpu2_mem_layout.overlay).
 *
 * No external wiring: OTBN ECDSA delegation runs entirely on-chip over the
 * pre-existing `mbox_consumer_otbn_crypto` node (board dts) -- nothing to
 * mux or connect here.
 */
